.TH THEDEAD 1
.SH NAME
thedead \- side-view shooter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/thedead
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I TheDead
is a side-view shooter.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Move up and down; hold space or Right to fire at approaching figures.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Up / w
Move up
.TP
.B Down / s
Move down
.TP
.B space / Right
Fire (linger hold)
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/thedead.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
